{"info": {"address1": "100 Feet Inner Ring Road", "address2": "No.1, 2nd and 3rd Floor Ejipura, Ashwini Layout Vivek Nagar", "city": "Bengaluru", "zip": "560047", "country": "India", "phone": "91 80 4081 2100", "website": "https://www.orklaindia.com", "industry": "Packaged Foods", "industryKey": "packaged-foods", "industryDisp": "Packaged Foods", "sector": "Consumer Defensive", "sectorKey": "consumer-defensive", "sectorDisp": "Consumer Defensive", "longBusinessSummary": "Orkla India Limited operates as a food company, manufactures and sells spices and convenience foods in India and internationally. It offers sambar, chicken, puliogare, rasam, and meat blended spice masala; and chilli, kashmiri chilli, turmeric, coriander, and cumin pure spices. The company also provides ready-to-cook, such as breakfast, sweet, and badam milk beverage mixes; ready-to-eat, includes paneer butter masala, dal makhani, and chana masala, as well as various rice dishes such as veg pulao and tomato rice; vermicelli and macaroni; badam drink and coffee beverages, pickles, ginger garlic paste, malabar parotas, cooking aids, pulses, rice, coconut milk, desserts, and other confectionery items. It sells its products through e-commerce websites and commerce platform under the MTR, Eastern, Rasoi Magic, Wok N Roll, and Laban brand names. The company was formerly known as MTR Foods Private Limited. The company was founded in 1924 and is based in Bengaluru, India. Orkla India Limited is a subsidiary of Orkla Asia Pacific Pte. Ltd.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sanjay  Sharma", "age": 59, "title": "CEO, MD & Director", "yearBorn": 1966, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Suniana  Calapa", "title": "Chief Financial Officer", "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ankur Kumar Bhaumik", "title": "Director of Operations", "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Milan  Chattaraj", "age"